Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.45,0:02:17.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.54,0:02:19.08,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't go down today?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.21,0:02:19.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.21,0:02:22.17,Default,,0,0,0,,The lower levels are closed today for setup.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.25,0:02:23.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Only the upper level is open.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.08,0:02:27.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Then let's explore Longyou City!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.70,0:02:28.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.21,0:02:36.00,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the manager of Lingxi Guild Hall.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.75,0:02:37.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Should I go get him?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.50,0:02:38.29,Default,,0,0,0,,No, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.46,0:02:39.29,Default,,0,0,0,,He comes here a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.29,0:02:40.54,Default,,0,0,0,,He's our hall manager's drinking buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.29,0:02:42.42,Default,,0,0,0,,He's probably just wandering around.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.67,0:02:43.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Just keep it in mind next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.78,0:02:44.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.75,0:02:47.91,Default,,0,0,0,,There are hall managers like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.04,0:02:54.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Look over there!
