Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.96,0:03:04.88,Default,,0,0,0,,That's...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.39,0:03:11.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Yan.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.96,0:03:15.29,Default,,0,0,0,,The person I ran into before...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.58,0:03:16.38,Default,,0,0,0,,That was you, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.44,0:03:19.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.25,0:03:21.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.33,0:03:23.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm looking forward to fighting you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.03,0:03:27.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Zhang.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.45,0:03:30.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You know each other?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.25,0:03:33.58,Default,,0,0,0,,We ran into each other in the game.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.71,0:03:35.42,Default,,0,0,0,,So that's what he looks like in real life?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.83,0:03:37.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Longyan.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.88,0:03:39.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Placed fifth in the last martial arts tournament.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.13,0:03:42.21,Default,,0,0,0,,He's one of the eight seeded contestants this year.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.83,0:03:46.29,Default,,0,0,0,,In a few years, the tournament should get even livelier.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.67,0:03:47.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.71,0:03:49.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Because of All Living Beings.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.00,0:03:51.08,Default,,0,0,0,,In just this one month,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.17,0:03:53.71,Default,,0,0,0,,we've found hundreds of people with talent worth training.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.75,0:03:57.71,Default,,0,0,0,,No era in history has ever been able to test
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.71,0:03:59.96,Default,,0,0,0,,hundreds of millions of people at once like we can now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.46,0:04:01.67,Default,,0,0,0,,With a base that large,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.04,0:04:05.63,Default,,0,0,0,,even one in a few hundred thousand\Nstill adds up to hundreds.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.50,0:04:08.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that why you made the game?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.67,0:04:09.95,Default,,0,0,0,,That's one reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.37,0:04:12.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Humans can only go so far in training.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.25,0:04:15.25,Default,,0,0,0,,So finding their talent\Nfor it isn't the main point.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.63,0:04:17.88,Default,,0,0,0,,But many people without the constitution for training
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.04,0:04:20.13,Default,,0,0,0,,turn out to be surprisingly good at using abilities.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.46,0:04:21.54,Default,,0,0,0,,For spirits,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.79,0:04:23.63,Default,,0,0,0,,the game is a rare training ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.88,0:04:25.21,Default,,0,0,0,,In the future, the way training works
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.25,0:04:27.29,Default,,0,0,0,,is going to change completely.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.46,0:04:30.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that a good thing or a bad thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.58,0:04:31.50,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't know yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.75,0:04:33.50,Default,,0,0,0,,So we'll have to keep a close eye on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.79,0:04:35.58,Default,,0,0,0,,It's like exploring uncharted territory.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.58,0:04:37.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm excited.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.71,0:04:40.54,Default,,0,0,0,,This passage is a fixed link.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.92,0:04:42.54,Default,,0,0,0,,It connects to Longyou City.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.13,0:04:44.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Once you pass through this ring,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.25,0:04:45.63,Default,,0,0,0,,you're already in Longyou City.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.08,0:04:49.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't the ring break?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.79,0:04:50.30,Default,,0,0,0,,It could.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.29,0:04:53.66,Default,,0,0,0,,What happens to someone right in the middle?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.21,0:04:56.17,Default,,0,0,0,,They'd probably be teleported randomly to one side.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.21,0:04:58.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it safe?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.46,0:05:00.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't linger at the connection point.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.67,0:05:03.72,Default,,0,0,0,,From here, it’s just a regular office building.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.72,0:05:04.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.43,0:05:16.38,Default,,0,0,0,,We really are in another city!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.39,0:05:17.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, look!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.50,0:05:18.46,Default,,0,0,0,,That's it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.83,0:05:20.00,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Fengxi Park!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.29,0:05:22.63,Default,,0,0,0,,It's so close!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.67,0:05:23.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Want to go see it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.46,0:05:26.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Are we allowed to just leave?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.40,0:05:26.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.50,0:05:29.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Xiaohei is the one with a task.
