Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.40,0:05:47.44,TS - Art Gallery,TS,0,0,0,,{=18}{\org(404.35,887.62)\pos(364.49,911.9)\fscx83.83\fscy83.83\fry5.98\frx-8.42\frz-71.81}Muyan Art Gallery
Comment: 0,0:05:46.40,0:05:47.44,TS - Cat Cafe,TS,0,0,0,,{=16}渣猫·猫咖 木炎画廊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.93,0:05:50.25,Default,,0,0,0,,So he's Lord Wuxian's disciple.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.81,0:05:51.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Yan.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.96,0:05:55.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Learning to judge your opponent's strength\Nis important too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.83,0:05:58.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Master, you think I can't beat him?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.83,0:05:59.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Yan...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.67,0:06:01.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep your voice down.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.75,0:06:04.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Even I can't beat him.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.83,0:06:07.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Only once you surpass me\Nmay you challenge him.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.79,0:06:08.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Understood?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.71,0:06:10.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.99,0:06:11.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Good boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.21,0:06:14.66,Default,,0,0,0,,His master would never let him enter.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.08,0:06:16.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be impatient.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.71,0:06:19.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Win this year's championship first.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.75,0:06:24.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Understood, Master.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.71,0:06:30.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Here you go, little one.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.21,0:06:33.83,Default,,0,0,0,,So many people!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.08,0:06:36.17,Default,,0,0,0,,This is Longyou City's most famous landmark.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.46,0:06:37.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I know, I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.63,0:06:41.13,Default,,0,0,0,,They say it suddenly appeared four years ago.\NThe Tree from Beyond the Sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.67,0:06:44.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Hall Manager, did you do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.75,0:06:47.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Not me. Someone much stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.06,0:06:52.10,TS - Cotton Candy,TS,0,0,0,,{\org(1653.0,883.9)\pos(1689,815.1)\fry-15.46\frx0.19\frz-0.20}Cotton Candy
Comment: 0,0:06:50.06,0:06:52.10,TS - Cotton Candy,TS,0,0,0,,棉花糖
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.33,0:06:51.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Give it to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.55,0:06:57.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you know when it appeared?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.62,0:06:58.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.84,0:07:06.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.33,0:07:09.33,Default,,0,0,0,,It's even bigger up close!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.67,0:07:12.08,Default,,0,0,0,,It's completely merged with the buildings.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.71,0:07:16.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is there a giant forest like this here?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.29,0:07:18.58,Default,,0,0,0,,It's one tree.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.08,0:07:21.58,Default,,0,0,0,,It spread underground and grew up from there.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.90,0:07:23.36,Default,,0,0,0,,So cool...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.75,0:07:28.88,Default,,0,0,0,,The Guild bought these buildings.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.17,0:07:32.29,Default,,0,0,0,,After reinforcing the damaged structures,\Nthey turned them into observation towers.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.71,0:07:34.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you been back since?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.38,0:07:37.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Want to go up and see?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.92,0:07:47.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Over here, over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.44,0:07:49.94,TS - Park,TS,0,0,0,,{\pos(1017.26,536.5)\frz312.2\c&H396E61&}Fengxi Park
Comment: 0,0:07:47.44,0:07:49.94,TS - Park,TS,0,0,0,,风息公园
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.71,0:07:48.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Cheese!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.42,0:07:51.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go, let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.77,0:08:00.02,TS - Flavors,TS,0,0,0,,{\org(1275.2,778.0)\pos(788.81,838.52)\fry0.45\frx2.57\frz-4.97\fax0.01}Vanilla
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.77,0:08:00.02,TS - Flavors,TS,0,0,0,,{\org(1275.2,778.0)\pos(824.28,838.73)\fry0.45\frx2.57\frz-4.97\fax0.01}Matcha
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.77,0:08:00.02,TS - Flavors,TS,0,0,0,,{\org(1275.2,778.0)\pos(868.27,838.95)\fry0.45\frx2.57\frz-4.97\fax0.01}Strawberry
Comment: 0,0:07:56.77,0:08:00.02,TS - Flavors,TS,0,0,0,,香草 抹茶 草莓
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.46,0:07:59.29,Default,,0,0,0,,This one's yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.17,0:08:05.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Mom, the kitty's eating ice cream!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.92,0:08:38.04,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the roof!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.33,0:08:39.63,Default,,0,0,0,,It's so big!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.79,0:08:40.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Mom, look over there!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.88,0:08:42.96,Default,,0,0,0,,My turn, my turn!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.92,0:08:46.00,Default,,0,0,0,,This is all one tree?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.21,0:08:47.92,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the park's top level.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.83,0:08:50.29,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't go up any higher?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.25,0:08:52.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Up there is a restricted area.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.96,0:08:54.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Only staff can go up.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.92,0:08:56.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Then are we...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.58,0:08:58.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Staff, obviously!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.92,0:09:01.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.87,0:09:02.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.56,0:09:12.60,TS - Poster,TS,0,0,0,,{\an6\pos(1228.87,33.15)}Fengxi Park\NManagement Office
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.56,0:09:12.60,TS - Poster,TS,0,0,0,,{\an6\pos(1228.87,123.57)}Internal Regulations
Comment: 0,0:09:10.56,0:09:12.60,TS - Poster,TS,0,0,0,,风息公园管理处 内部守则
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.92,0:09:12.21,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a spirit up there.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.83,0:09:14.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it staff?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.42,0:09:15.08,Default,,0,0,0,,No idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.38,0:09:16.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not good at sensing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.00,0:09:18.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I couldn't even tell there was a spirit up there.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.14,0:09:19.66,Default,,0,0,0,,However,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.00,0:09:21.88,Default,,0,0,0,,many spirits have come to Longyou these past few days.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.08,0:09:24.17,Default,,0,0,0,,It's normal for a few to be sightseeing here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.13,0:09:56.79,Default,,0,0,0,,This is an open rooftop.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.79,0:09:57.58,Default,,0,0,0,,It's dangerous,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.88,0:09:59.08,Default,,0,0,0,,so it's off-limits.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.29,0:10:00.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay safe, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.43,0:10:00.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.50,0:10:03.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't they build a walkway?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.63,0:10:05.83,Default,,0,0,0,,The Guild says nothing can be built on the tree.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.96,0:10:06.96,Default,,0,0,0,,It'd get in the way of its growth.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.71,0:10:09.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it still growing?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.83,0:10:12.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Could it knock the buildings down someday?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.79,0:10:14.21,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a team monitoring it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.21,0:10:15.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.75,0:10:16.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Kali!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.19,0:10:17.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Xiaoshi?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.00,0:10:19.25,Default,,0,0,0,,When did you get here?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.71,0:10:20.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll go say hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.29,0:10:28.87,Default,,0,0,0,,So high up...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.08,0:10:30.42,Default,,0,0,0,,So scary...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.58,0:10:33.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to head over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.42,0:10:34.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.38,0:10:35.34,Default,,0,0,0,,From here?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.29,0:10:37.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I can handle things here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.22,0:10:37.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.13,0:10:39.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.17,0:10:47.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Just looking makes my legs shake.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.13,0:10:51.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Xiaohei's just like he is in the game.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.17,0:10:54.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you think someone might\Nbring that game feeling out with them
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.92,0:10:56.46,Default,,0,0,0,,and just jump off?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.46,0:10:58.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Scary!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.96,0:11:01.46,Default,,0,0,0,,The game and reality feel very different.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.58,0:11:04.46,Default,,0,0,0,,That's probably part of why play time is limited.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.67,0:11:52.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm Xiaohei.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.17,0:11:54.46,Default,,0,0,0,,What's your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.19,0:12:12.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.29,0:12:14.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.92,0:12:17.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you staff?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.92,0:12:19.71,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not stuck up here, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.50,0:12:23.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you need help?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.50,0:12:40.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm coming over!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.37,0:13:01.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Xiaohei...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.08,0:13:05.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You've gotten so strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.26,0:13:11.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Luozhu...?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.23,0:13:21.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's take a look.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.75,0:13:24.42,Default,,0,0,0,,One more!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.88,0:13:27.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Three, two, one!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.64,0:13:28.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Cheese!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.79,0:13:42.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.08,0:13:49.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you here to keep Fengxi company?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.34,0:13:53.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I work part-time at a flower shop nearby.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.87,0:13:55.04,Default,,0,0,0,,When I'm not busy,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.25,0:13:56.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.87,0:13:58.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it close?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.13,0:14:03.00,Default,,0,0,0,,When did you get here?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.54,0:14:05.33,Default,,0,0,0,,A little over two years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.33,0:14:07.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's Tianhu?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.42,0:14:11.08,Default,,0,0,0,,He's still being held at the Guild.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.88,0:14:16.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you know where I was?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.79,0:14:18.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.46,0:14:23.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Why didn't you come find me?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.67,0:14:31.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't hate you, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.66,0:14:36.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I've missed you a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.54,0:14:50.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Can I come visit you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.54,0:14:55.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Can I
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.71,0:14:57.17,Default,,0,0,0,,come see you, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.50,0:14:59.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.00,0:15:11.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, Lord Wuxian.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.50,0:15:13.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Luozhu was cleared by the Telepathy Division.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.46,0:15:15.50,Default,,0,0,0,,He's no danger to Xiaohei.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.63,0:15:16.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.29,0:15:18.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Time to get ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.54,0:15:19.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Go get him.